<apex:component controller="CaseJeopardyCtrl" access="global">
    <apex:attribute name="EmailCaseId" description="Case Id for email sending" type="String" assignTo="{!caseId}" />
    <apex:attribute name="EmailJeopardyHistoryId" description="Jeopardy History Id for email sending" type="String"
        assignTo="{!jeopardyHistoryId}" />
<!-- component to be used in Email Messaging -->
Good day {!jeopardyCase.CreatedBy.Name}!

This is to inform you that a jeopardy has been applied on a Salesforce Case.

Salesforce Case: {!jeopardyCase.CaseNumber}
Case Creator: {!jeopardyCase.CreatedBy.Name}
Case Owner: {!jeopardyCase.Owner.Name}
Jeopardy: {!jeopardyHistory.Jeopardy__c}
Jeopardy Description: {!jeopardyHistory.Sub_Jeopardy__c}
Jeopardy Aging: {!jeopardyHistory.jeopardy_Age_Business_Days__c}

Jeopardy Remarks from Telco Ops Numbers:
{!jeopardyHistory.Jeopardy_Remark__c}

Kindly address the applied jeopardy. For more information please contact your case owner: {!jeopardyCase.Case_Owner_Email__c}

Please be informed that the jeopardy applied should be addressed within 4 business days. In the event that the jeopardy still exist on the 5th day of aging, your salesforce case will be closed.

Supporting Documents:

    Requests for Phone Numbers:
    https://wiki.ringcentral.com/display/OPS/Requests+for+Phone+Numbers

